      "GRANDMA GEORGINA: Fire, where?\nGRANDMA JOSEPHINE: Nowhere, dear.",
      "GRANDMA GEORGINA: I am not!\nGRANDMA JOSEPHINE: Of course you aren’t, dear.",
      "MS. BEAUREGARDE: These are just some of the 263 trophies and medals my Violet has won.\nVIOLET: I'm a gumchewer, mostly, but when I heard about these ticket things, I laid off the gum and switched to candy bars.\nMS. BEAUREGARDE: She is just a driven young woman. I don’t know what it is about her.\nVIOLET: I’m the junior world-champion gum chewer. This piece of gum I'm chewing I've been working on for over three months solid. That's a record.",
      "GRANDMA JOSEPHINE: What a beastly girl.\nGRANDMA GEORGINA: Despicable!",
      "VERUCA: Let’s be friends.\nVIOLET: Best friends."
    ]
